{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:14ecc65533e4a2b46b6383d86b63c28187ad27f4ec3ca1a8132ce0583ed1fa16",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c21ebca70d5a3ea97dfc734da81b54bf8a9d1cff0d5af206b53acbbdeabbfab",
      "text": "独自一人的海，与大家同看的海",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e7ecfe1ef96a67447a682ee39231f0823e6e4c26481ebf8a923366f9f21a098",
      "text": "生日当天，克里斯照常一大早就潜入海中，\n感受着大海的美丽。收到来自家人与\nLegenders成员们的祝福讯息，如沐浴在晨光中的\n海面般耀眼的特别一天就此开始。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6313f279589e4d02417b9ecc2dfa72c00fd985128dc5bb6d1cda3361d5d8694",
      "text": "雨彦先生，让你久等了～\n要开始准备克里斯先生的生日会了吗～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b3470b5c08dcb27e69f3712c537f9e3fd023c30a6691b15b42e0169f3488537",
      "text": "啊啊，也是。\n毕竟是古论，应该会准时或者提早到吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a87df973c9719c752cdeab12a4973404039028c0a4e3edc3a3587568e361c3fe",
      "text": "在那之前，我去把蛋糕取回来。\n我的私事也很快就能办完回来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2c8b5bf3b34de9f2868b0aca32754a415ed9f09b42b6400166a9a37b12fca2a",
      "text": "拜托你啦～布置餐桌之类的事情，\n我会先弄好的～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcd3c676896a776283f78f1f599efcad2a7b5315eca60edfe0018fd70d6057c2",
      "text": "啊啊，交给你了。\n那我出门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cbcf3389f960d93b3aea060b93045b8060fbd550160de96077123333165c169",
      "text": "今年大家的时间都能空出来，真是太好了呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02e58c612611cba556b5f2e06a8d43bcf5da71b80abb041b91c2a98232cc7300",
      "text": "是啊，确实如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bc50a24f40e03a20d39773ee36f81d50a2484d6d78768bb30aa87cdf91edddc",
      "text": "不仅能和各位悠闲地交谈，\n还度过了一段非常快乐的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4859d38f32b22c34dd386eee24fe723b6f2562c5400258feae7cde98b3f0375d",
      "text": "朝霞映碧波，欢语水面跃。对克里斯先生来说\n要是能成为一个美好的生日，那就太好啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:264f35c9c00cb2ab03496cef03aad640ab36b82327c2904bdb23e2d59e8aa3d7",
      "text": "非常感谢。\n真是一首令人难忘的绝妙俳句啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b46583a05eea19ea113bc2d52518cb56751e8b40064c4640a07029a50da3ba5",
      "text": "各位为我准备的生日蛋糕，\n将大海完美地重现了出来，实在是太棒了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fac146a12d52c8aaa4e7745d94f536aff620b872861ccd354df007cb56550cd",
      "text": "你能喜欢就再好不过了。那是和制作人还有\n北村商量之后订的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1cbdcc9c322344957cc196cd282d03e478f4f30e3739bdd147524866d9f62d8",
      "text": "既然要订，\n就想着订个古论可能会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e6b03cffd384edf727c99a8cefeb1faceb6c28a25e5fe07fac395b9f41d6628",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_046chr_2_1_2_046_12:1_2_046_12_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1a4b34b82a12684a9c6021c3f2de23d75d2e396cfbe17cfd67021cf2f5da6db",
      "text": "那个蛋糕之所以会那么美味，\n也是因为里面倾注了大家的心意吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
